<urn:atm:triage:finding/BA3-PRE-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "BA3-PRE-001" ;
  triage:title "BA.3 workspace does not compile: notify() removed from HerdrProcessAdapter but bootstrap still implements it" ;
  triage:description "fenix pre-review of BA.3 COMPLETE sha 82ff24ded (PR #1402), comment https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1402#issuecomment-5642824942. Verified on a detached worktree of 82ff24ded with a fresh target dir. cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features (and any workspace build) fails: error[E0407]: method `notify` is not a member of trait `HerdrProcessAdapter` at crates/atm-daemon-bootstrap/src/received_hook_selector.rs:221. The notify method was removed from atm_herdr::HerdrProcessAdapter (per an earlier ruling) but the bootstrap implementation still provides it, so the push's claimed \"cargo test --workspace --no-fail-fast\" cannot actually have run against this tree. Fix task BA3-FIX-R1 dispatched to arch-ctm." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
